<title>NETHERLANDS: HOOGOVENS CHAIRMAN TO RETIRE IN 1998.</title>
<headline>HOOGOVENS CHAIRMAN TO RETIRE IN 1998.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERWIJK, Netherlands 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch steel and aluminium group Hoogovens NV said on Thursday that Chairman Maarten van Veen intended to retire as from April next year.</p>
<p>His retirement will take effect from the General Meeting of Shareholders in April 1998, Hoogovens said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>Hoogovens' supervisory board has appointed Fokko van Duyne, member of the Board of Management since 1987, as his successor.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
